# FINAL V23 EXECUTION DIRECTIVE

Complete V23 as a major extension of the existing ECONEX Universal Economic Operating System.

The most important strategic outcome is that **every eligible ECONEX participant should have one permanent ECONEX wallet number that can identify their wallet across all activated ECONEX countries**.

The wallet must support a future ecosystem in which individuals, merchants, companies, professionals, cooperatives and institutions can transact within the ECONEX network using a shared internal transaction infrastructure.

ECONEX must own and control its wallet identity architecture, account model, internal ledger, transaction rules, merchant acceptance software and economic-network integration.

Do not make an external money-transfer application a mandatory dependency for ECONEX-to-ECONEX internal ledger functionality.

However, do not confuse internal ledger entries with actual external settlement, cash withdrawal, deposit, electronic-money issuance or card-network acceptance. Keep all real-value operations disabled until the required legal, regulatory, security, safeguarding and settlement conditions have been satisfied.

Preserve the universal, multi-sector ECONEX mission. The wallet must serve the entire economic network, not become a separate agriculture wallet or a standalone mobile-money clone.

**Do not start V24 automatically.** Complete V23, verify it, produce the final delivery report and wait for the next instruction.